#: ../data/glib-2.0/schemas/com.canonical.Myna.Dictation.gschema.xml:39
msgid "How transcripts are emitted"
msgstr ""

#: ../data/glib-2.0/schemas/com.canonical.Myna.Dictation.gschema.xml:40
msgid ""
"streaming: partial hypotheses appear in the field as you speak. batch: the "
"transcript is injected once, when the utterance ends. auto: resolved per "
"machine against the measured RTF tier table, which is also what decides "
"whether in-field partials are shown at all. Changes apply live."
msgstr ""

#: ../data/glib-2.0/schemas/com.canonical.Myna.Dictation.gschema.xml:51
msgid "Language hint sent to the backend"
msgstr ""

#: ../data/glib-2.0/schemas/com.canonical.Myna.Dictation.gschema.xml:52
msgid ""
"A BCP-47-ish code (en, fr, zh) passed to the inference backend as a session "
"hint. Empty means \"let the backend decide\", which is what a multilingual "
"model does best. Changes apply live."
msgstr ""

#: ../data/glib-2.0/schemas/com.canonical.Myna.Dictation.gschema.xml:62
msgid "How a press reaches the daemon"
msgstr ""

#: ../data/glib-2.0/schemas/com.canonical.Myna.Dictation.gschema.xml:63
msgid ""
"auto: the portal where the app is packaged (the compositor can only identify "
"a packaged app), the control socket otherwise. portal and control force one "
"- a wrong choice here means the hotkey does nothing, so auto is nearly "
"always right. Restart the Myna daemon after changing this setting."
msgstr ""

#: ../data/glib-2.0/schemas/com.canonical.Myna.Dictation.gschema.xml:74
msgid "Preferred shortcut offered to the portal"
msgstr ""

#: ../data/glib-2.0/schemas/com.canonical.Myna.Dictation.gschema.xml:75
msgid ""
"An accelerator such as '<Super>d'. It is a *preference*: under portal "
"activation the desktop's own bind dialog owns the final choice, and empty "
"means \"offer no preference\". Restart the Myna daemon after changing this "
"setting."
msgstr ""

#: ../data/glib-2.0/schemas/com.canonical.Myna.Dictation.gschema.xml:85
msgid "The HUD indicator style"
msgstr ""

#: ../data/glib-2.0/schemas/com.canonical.Myna.Dictation.gschema.xml:86
msgid ""
"bar: a simple level bar in the accent colour (the default). ribbon: the "
"flowing GPU wave ribbon. vumeter: the classic segmented bar meter. progress: "
"a plain GtkProgressBar. All are driven by the same calibrated audio "
"envelope; only the presentation differs. Changes apply live."
msgstr ""
